					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Ok guys, ive read multiple places that theres clarity 3,or C3 as everyone calls it, can anyone please confirm this for me,it would be much appreciated <br />
<br />
thanks<br />
mez						</td>
					</tr>
