			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3597">Kaledine</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">2/8/2002 - 3:45 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2879">Kaledine Ursamaje</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2917">Karuune Bogglesworth</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2918">Dambae Meadowlark</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														There's no C3, per se, Mez.  However, there is Koadic's Endless Intellect, which is +14 WIS and INT, and has higher mana regen than C2, PLUS it's a group spell.  However (and you already knew this), it is a level 60 dropped spell from Luclin.  <br />
<br />
NOTE:  This spell is no longer known as Koadic's, as it has herein been renamed &quot;God&quot;.<br />
<br />
:)  Kaledine/Dambae/Karuune						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3023">Maysun</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">2/11/2002 - 7:02 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2670">Maysun Researcher</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2733">Olloder</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2950">Shantillie</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														This spell does exist, it is a Luclin spell that drops of an uber mob, it is a level 60 enchanter spell. I have only heard of it spoke of in whispers for fear that the nerf god will come down and smite that which is good.<br />
<br />
Being a master of mana all I can say is.<br />
<br />
HIT ME ONE MORE TIME WITH SOME CLARITY BABY!!!<br />
<br />
Um, was that outloud?						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
