				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3468">Tryuna</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">2/12/2002 - 4:31 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2771">Tryuna Thrallsbane</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I have had this spell casted on me.. and I must say being able to cast to my hearts content when soloing is a wonderful thing (without loosing mana that is).<br />
Let us all hope the mighty nerfing arm of that evil god Verant does not think we like this spell too much!						</td>
